  "adaptations": {
    "bic": "Persistent class-introduction holdout never enters feature training or replay; up to20 heldout plus180 training-memory slots per class. Balanced calibration uses min available heldout per seen class; latest-task alpha/beta fitted with frozen model and folded into head before next task. Adam instead of original SGD.",
